Hi ${object.notification_to_partner_id.name}
${object.get_internal_document()} has requested your approval for ${object.get_internal_description()} - ${object.get_internal_number()} .

Please review and take the appropriate action.

${object.get_internal_url() | safe}

This is a reminder that ${object.get_internal_description()} "${object.get_internal_number()}" from ${object.get_internal_requestor().name} has been waiting for your approval for ${object.aging} days.
Please review the request at your earliest convenience.
${object.get_internal_url() | safe}
